    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive distal muscle weakness with characteristic rimmed vacuoles on muscle biopsy; genetic confirmation supports diagnosis",
    "notes": "Genetic testing may not always identify a mutation; diagnosis relies on clinical and histopathological correlation."
